  "schema:description": "Rapid sites across western NSW to check VCA classification. The sites recorded here are part florsitics or canopy cover. Go to NSWVCA-FF for full floristics plots. Most sites in the VCA checks were part florsitics but all stops record GPS and ID number in VCA classification + photos.. The NSWVCA(Rapid sites across western NSW to check VCA classification. The sites recorded here are part florsitics or canopy cover. Go to NSWVCA-FF for full floristics plots. Most sites in the VCA checks were part florsitics but all stops record GPS and ID number in VCA classification + photos.) Survey is part of the Vegetation Information System Survey Program of New South Wales which is a series of systematic vegetation surveys conducted across the state between 1970 and the present. Please use the following URL to access the dataset: http://aekos.org.au/collection/nsw.gov.au/nsw_atlas/vis_flora_module/NSWVCA\n\nProject: NSWVCA Vegetation Survey, Data from the Atlas of NSW database: VIS flora survey module",
